{"title":"1992 AHSME Problems/Problem 7","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The ratio of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/e/9ee4b825a2e36ae093ed7be5e4851ef453b34914.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$w$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"10\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/e/f/def7726c2babb527f7ab2ae4c436cc012ebbd351.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4:3$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"32\" height=\"13\" />, of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/3/b13f21416d84e13708696f34dea81026cda583c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/e/80e47d95347d6e72d1b3e8a4aea3dd20082f3cc3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3:2$\" width=\"32\" height=\"12\" /> and of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/3/b13f21416d84e13708696f34dea81026cda583c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/7/9272fbcdbe136e6528e3f6d3ded14eaead70d0ce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1:6$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"32\" height=\"13\" />. What is the ratio of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/e/9ee4b825a2e36ae093ed7be5e4851ef453b34914.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$w$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"10\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/f/82f905af2383b6ca1c816814b28b4b51c82ab859.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A) } 1:3\\quad \\text{(B) } 16:3\\quad \\text{(C) } 20:3\\quad \\text{(D) } 27:4\\quad \\text{(E) } 12:1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"421\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/c/13c3218ca790f4eac4048f34f68433655b19e1f4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\fbox{B}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" />\n</p><p>Converting from ratios to fractions\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/3/8e326e61d7565edb30c87b18aca27e3d80a6d5e2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{w}{x}=\\frac{4}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"53\" height=\"37\" />,\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/d/ceddfe824e2a38ffd5e0516bcfae35bb47393f56.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{y}{z}=\\frac{3}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"49\" height=\"37\" />,\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/2/442a388338229bd490b60135d03568f8f827d328.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{z}{x}=\\frac{1}{6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"50\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p><br />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/7/9/479826e2e1da0e8f458b5a158ce8d2841785a406.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{y}{z} \\cdot \\frac{z}{x} = \\frac{3}{2} \\cdot \\frac{1}{6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"103\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/8/648f239c946a8576816e05d31680baf79961515e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{y}{x} = \\frac{1}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"50\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/b/efb6d109369cb460ac25286cec30c3f4104b5396.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{(\\frac{w}{x})}{(\\frac{y}{x})}=\\frac{\\frac{4}{3}}{\\frac{1}{4}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"69\" height=\"47\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/4/684445707b3d8c0a625093c9c2a27824b6c57122.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{w}{y} = \\frac{16}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"62\" height=\"41\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/e/9ee4b825a2e36ae093ed7be5e4851ef453b34914.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$w$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"10\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/7/ac77ac0b14a0626345cd3309160ffc06e2212568.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$16:3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"44\" height=\"14\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME\" title=\"1992 AHSME\">1992 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1992 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1992\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=